  "body": "Zoning: Mixed Housing Suburban\r\nSubdivision Consent Application: Available\r\nSpread across two levels, this spacious family home features three bedrooms, two bathrooms, two generously-sized living areas, and a kitchen. The versatile living spaces cater to families of all shapes and sizes, with plenty of room for both adults and kids. The expansive lawn provides ample space for the property to grow and evolve alongside your family.\r\nHighlights:\r\nPrime Location: Situated on a popular street with ongoing developments, offering a marvellous setting.\r\nOutdoor Space: North-facing garden with a concrete inground swimming pool (in need of renovation).\r\nConvenience: Walking distance to beaches, shops, and excellent schools. Easy motorway access, close to Northcross shops, Shorecare Accident & Medical Centre, and Albany Mega Centre.\r\nTop Schools: Zoned for Rangitoto College, Sherwood School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Northcross Intermediate.\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to secure a substantial piece of land in a sought-after area with immense potential for future growth. Contact us today to arrange a viewing and explore the possibilities this property has to offer!",
